        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Description of the mapping itself can be updated to show its up to date action. Either manually or via [set_mapping_desc()](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/7a75a970d0bae09ef579e41dbb20551bdf596f31/doc/mini-clue.txt#L632).\r\n\r\nUnfortunately I had tried that and the descriptions could easily get out of sync, such as when creating a `ts_highlight` toggle mapping before treesitter had been configured. Thank you anyways for taking a look!",
