            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I had tried that and the descriptions could easily get out of sync, such as when creating a `ts_highlight` toggle mapping before treesitter had been configured.\r\n\r\nThis does indeed look like an issue with creating a toggling mapping. And if there is a way to keep 'mini.clue' clues up to date (as this PR suggests it as a dynamic fallback), then calling `set_mapping_desc()` can be done at that same place. If there is mapping yet, then it can be created with the initial description.",
