        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> And if there is a way to keep 'mini.clue' clues up to date (as this PR suggests it as a dynamic fallback), then calling set_mapping_desc() can be done at that same place.\r\n\r\nIt had just occured to me that this could work without any changes by providing the clue `desc` as a function that simply calls `set_mapping_desc`, as the `desc` function will be evaluated before the keymap `desc` overwrites it. Thank you for the *clues*!",
